  "description": "Living alone in the forest ever since his family was framed and killed, Byeo-Ru has lived a simple life: gathering food from nature, living in a small house, and avoiding the village people who aren’t aware that he’s still alive. He’s fine living that way, until the day he finds a dragon’s egg. Once hatched, dragon Shin-Ri changes Byeo-Ru’s life into a more complicated one. Whether that is a good thing, Byeo-Ru himself is not quite sure…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 30 extra chapters.*",
